{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-cech-cohomology-cohomology}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7d9d4bd04165ec947d6cce1468745d33d3949a00e45f5e8124fd19f727acb3b6", "source_text": "<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology and cohomology", "source_text_hash": "sha256:55553dc81af9986a15df12b150a6a7a78a7f7053270f911e9cc31b20542d32dd", "unit_id": "tag:03AV:title"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "ACCENT_0002": "\\v C", "ACCENT_0003": "\\v C", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPCLOSE_0002": "}", "GROUPCLOSE_0003": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{", "GROUPOPEN_0002": "{", "GROUPOPEN_0003": "{", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dd02d3531f7fa608ffc2fe1ad83afc0f30a0eb9cdb7b1a5c78323ed657e4236f", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe relationship between cohomology and <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology comes from the fact\nthat the <GROUPOPEN_0002><ACCENT_0002><GROUPCLOSE_0002>ech cohomology of an injective abelian sheaf is zero. To see this\nwe note that an injective abelian sheaf is an injective abelian presheaf and\nthen we apply results in <GROUPOPEN_0003><ACCENT_0003><GROUPCLOSE_0003>ech cohomology in the preceding section.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7bd020ea70bd9165b746466815827baf737d3fc22a592392c127fba987c8e7ac", "unit_id": "tag:03AV:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-injective-abelian-sheaf-injective-presheaf}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:773d59abeed4abc753f392faef5e56d314610c064bc7cb80d18aaca3635647ac", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ac3c0b7335b87a9495f95f635a6597230c365d05eb754fc674dd7fd2152e3342", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site. An injective abelian sheaf is also injective as an\nobject in the category <MATH_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c6dcd9d9c7d0905130ad18f2f7b83e048e708fafa0450ed214fbf9b1056b3aba", "unit_id": "tag:03F6:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{A} = \\textit{Ab}(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{B} = \\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{homology-lemma-adjoint-preserve-injectives}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{sites-modules-section-abelian-sheaves}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:35b4823125790fdcbc605bdca07a22993385d80cd640120b2be5dfc2443f4967", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9536f8167c6e7de072700844fa9c6abcceace9e5ca525807af71b9d09b631a3c", "source_text": "Apply Homology, Lemma <REF_0001>\nto the categories <MATH_0001>,\n<MATH_0002>, the inclusion functor\nand sheafification. (See\nModules on Sites, Section <REF_0002> to see\nthat all assumptions of the lemma are satisfied.)\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3d344d6a9b9cb946eaec9371965d721378ea33230e93d4877ed5a7b67da290fd", "unit_id": "tag:03F6:proof"}
