 {"end": 113630, "start": 113150}, "container_hash": "sha256:1f8b7297bb312d0763313dbc731b16e22e5f58304298f1949d35681ba4b954c1"}, {"command_byte_span": {"end": 113459, "start": 113450}, "command_hash": "sha256:9bf8ff9496f0daeb9f5e7134b709854235c7095850835c60d960675841a7eed6", "container_byte_span": {"end": 113630, "start": 113150}, "container_hash": "sha256:1f8b7297bb312d0763313dbc731b16e22e5f58304298f1949d35681ba4b954c1"}], "ordinal": 1, "owner_label": "sheaves-lemma-skyscraper-stalks", "owner_tag": "009B", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14"}, "policy_hash": "sha256:acf06b6ce535cbc1b73e5c23191282cb4d4ae2bada1e2793d6b76b4deff666d0", "source_label": "sheaves-lemma-skyscraper-stalks", "usage": "matrix-condition", "usage_source": {"after": " &", "before": "& ", "environments": ["matrix"]}}, "command": "text", "policy_entry": "matrix-if", "slot_byte_span": {"end": 116, "start": 114}, "slot_id": "math/0001/text/0002", "source": "if"}], "source": "$$\n\\check{H}^p(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{I}) =\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\mathcal{I}(U) & \\text{if} & p = 0 \\\\\n0 & \\text{if} & p > 0\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right.\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 416, "start": 267}, "source_hash": "sha256:26960f89bfaf6e51f3528abd0f0181e585206325e36f8e5297178f623e2c683d"}], "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\check{H}^p(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{I}) =\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\mathcal{I}(U) & \\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "} & p = 0 \\\\\n0 & \\text{", "MATHSEG_0003": "} & p > 0\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right.\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\textit{Ab}(\\mathcal{C})$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-injective-trivial-cech}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e6e8a59774d59ed767f73be4fe63afeaf9f8cb5917d098395f0db590d966fe2a", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:d889be254fba6551272867e07d9c6f3a10e8522db2ca4e2130b43ca6987120bf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4d082b717ebce546a999e015d6924ff65bb8d1b779f76677efde11b22ac2fd3a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a covering of <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an injective abelian sheaf, i.e., an injective\nobject of <MATH_0005>.\nThen\n<MATHSEG_0001>if<MATHSEG_0002>if<MATHSEG_0003>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e1d7c3ee7bbd6ecb7d98618f927f82cf6d12dcb13fc724be8e37f742c325fcaa", "unit_id": "tag:03AW:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03AV", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{I}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-injective-abelian-sheaf-injective-presheaf}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-cech-cohomology-derived-presheaves}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-cech-h0}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4c7f7a861be4eb90b1f2dc22eda323dc801efdd8cd8dfe6599698c03495b3cb5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3682294c7e954f9d22c47d3fd8ca8ff6804a603ac33885e73b64c1106496da21", "source_text": "By Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe see that <MATH_0001> is an injective object in\n<MATH_0002>.\nHence we can apply Lemma <REF_0002>\n(or its proof) to see the vanishing of higher <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech cohomology group.\nFor the zeroth see Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:87a8208c067aaf2aa733ab1cd5c14d7ab83e284f21943faf6beeef3db5f5866e", "unit_id": "tag:03AW:proof"}
